# Local coding-agent rules

- Use the local Ollama provider only. Do not use cloud providers or API credits.
- Use qwen2.5-coder:7b unless the user explicitly selects another local model.
- Work one feature at a time.
- Read the relevant files before editing.
- Make the smallest focused change and run targeted tests immediately afterward.
- Do not submit job applications automatically; keep human approval required.
- Do not commit secrets, credentials, databases, resume documents, or generated caches.
- Before committing, run the relevant tests and inspect git status.
